48	 * it. The usual cause is a page reload mid-turn: the client vanishes, the
49	 * request is cancelled, and the persisted status is never advanced. Without a
50	 * staleness escape the session is stuck forever — the same failure shape as a
51	 * dangling tool_use.
52	 */
53	const STALE_TURN_MS = 90_000;
